  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young City Makers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The new urban generation is growing up in an increasingly complex world with big challenges.  At the same time young people take the streets or fight for their future in other ways. We need a new generation city makers who find new solutions to urban challenges. Technology won&apos;t be enough. A new way of thinking and doing is essential. YCM prepares all youngsters with the right skills to create a better future, starting today.</narrative>
  </description>
